                        "review": "Game runs fine, and I got it on the cheap so money/ time factor is there. \r\nBut the game itself has some flaws that are decreasing fun for me.\r\nI like those shooters where you run a map and fight a lot of enemies.\r\nBut this has some big flaws - endlessly respawning enemies at specific points of map, there is no save in the middle of the mission, so you have to run the whole mission in one session, very few weapon choices.\r\nScenario is... passable.\r\n6/10, game is not bad just less fun than expected.",
